Package: rustcache
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Traineratwot <Traineratwot@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Traineratwot/RustCache
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1
Description: Caching HTTP/HTTPS proxy with MITM and disk cache
 RustCache is a caching HTTP/HTTPS proxy with TLS MITM (local root CA),
 on-disk + in-memory cache, SOCKS5 tunnel and a local REST API/web UI.
 .
 System install runs as user `rustcache` with data in /var/lib/rustcache
 and config in /etc/rustcache/config.toml.
